---
// Post 20 (Alpha) figure: space. Inline SVG, site tokens only. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp20-space">
  <div class="atp20-space-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 340" role="img" aria-label="Bars on a log scale: formulas up to depth 1 number 896, depth 2 about 11 million, depth 3 about 1.8e15, depth 4 about 4.4e31.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>How many formulas fit in a small grammar</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một ngữ pháp nhỏ chứa được bao nhiêu công thức</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="50" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>7 inputs, 29 one-input operators (window sizes included), 14 two-input operators. Bars are log10 of the count.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>7 đầu vào, 29 phép một ngôi (đã tính cỡ cửa sổ), 14 phép hai ngôi. Thanh là log10 của số công thức.</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="108" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Depth 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Độ sâu 1</tspan></text>
<rect x="120" y="90" width="56" height="26" rx="4" class="okb" />
<text x="186.0938521835804" y="108" class="b">8.96e2</text>
<text x="20" y="166" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Depth 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Độ sâu 2</tspan></text>
<rect x="120" y="148" width="134" height="26" rx="4" class="okb" />
<text x="263.9831967063989" y="166" class="b">1.13e7</text>
<text x="20" y="224" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Depth 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Độ sâu 3</tspan></text>
<rect x="120" y="206" width="290" height="26" rx="4" class="okb" />
<text x="419.74282760794665" y="224" class="b">1.78e15</text>
<text x="20" y="282" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Depth 4</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Độ sâu 4</tspan></text>
<rect x="120" y="264" width="601" height="26" rx="4" class="badb" />
<text x="731.2620878937797" y="282" class="b">4.42e31</text>
<line x1="410" y1="74" x2="410" y2="290" class="mutl" />
<text x="417.74282760794665" y="88" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Alpha#101 lives at depth 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Alpha#101 nằm ở độ sâu 3</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="322" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Depth 4 is 4.42e31 trees. At a million tries a second, one pass takes about 1.4e18 years.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Độ sâu 4 là 4,42e31 cây. Một triệu lần thử mỗi giây thì quét một lượt mất khoảng 1,4e18 năm.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The count grows by squaring at each level. Nobody searches this space by listing it; the search has to sample.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Số công thức tăng theo bình phương ở mỗi tầng. Không ai liệt kê hết được; việc tìm kiếm buộc phải lấy mẫu.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp20-space { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp20-space-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp20-space svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp20-space text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp20-space .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-space .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-space .xs { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-space .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-space .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-space .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-space .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-space .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp20-space .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-space .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-space .node { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-space .leaf { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-space .nodeg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-space .noder { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-space .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .atp20-space .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-space .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-space .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-space .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-space .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-space .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-space .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp20-space .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp20-space .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp20-space .tick { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .atp20-space figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>